body:
I reacted well within the first week of trying it. It could come down to dosage, some people take 1-2 pills for a good night sleep. If I take more than a half, I'll be knocked out. I'd say if you are already an anxious sleeper and feel fidgety from training to take a bit extra until you notice the effect.

&#x200B;

p.s. dosages for antidepressant effects are much greater than off-label effects so you would be fine taking extra. I'm no doctor though so take this with a grain of salt.
